<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-17T19:38:48.280Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:38:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian authorities abducted a suspect in an Assad-era massacre from Lebanon and arrested the “Butcher of Baniyas” for the 2013 coastal massacres, while two Syrian pipelines were damaged in recent attacks on energy infrastructure. Israeli Prime Minister Netanyahu spoke directly with President Ahmed al-Sharaa after a 2025 strike in Damascus, a conversation that Syrian sources said involved U.S. and Arab mediation, and a Druze leader praised Netanyahu’s intervention. A Syrian soldier was killed and another seriously injured while clearing mines in the Homs countryside. Authorities foiled an ISIS plot to target a police patrol in Damascus countryside. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPS2JjWFgtb3diSHFwYXZ4SnFpdGNndXlsYjJPeDRXSUpoZXI1TkktdTdYQW1DZnBjVWhzZnhMLWhnWXNRX19uYnBmalhyX25HSUd6Z0J2WWRnZFluUFptMWlzbV9odXFaTTVPOXFweE9hRDdoTmhFMkhMVHJnVy01djNOdktQWkZGZ0QxaEFFQ211UDB1VGlEQ3ZIZnJIQXN6OHZjaXNzSzJzUVIwVjRjT0R2T01vczhK?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQdnVjS2Z5NTMwMndLT1d3SXpnNmt2a2xnU21lWE8wQ0lQTTkyUUtKSXdZTkVDNlZFWHREaERBWFF0bkR4Ui0zM3FMc3VGZVB3aHI1LU5UTG5NZXIybjZfQ2xJcDZSMDRYbnBZRmJKRWJXcm5TR1k0SkplZlNXTkljZlpQclJHNjRuSm94S2ZUQVlQSnUwQzEzT0JZWjFrNVA2VGl0VA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNczh2cS1pNUJuU3d2XzVTNW5jZ05Vd0pNMTZCakJia1ZvZ1ZsWVh4dlp2dWhadjFxd0MzSF9ycGU5Q2pEWWFlLVZaNmtIMjVrdnBleUsxUnM2Y3NOeUtoaF94Uk5QbUk4MldwN2